---
// Career & Academic Chronicle Component
---

<section id="experience" class="space-y-8 scroll-mt-24 pt-8">
  <!-- Section Heading -->
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between border-b border-[#1E293B] pb-4 gap-4">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#38BDF8] font-mono text-xs tracking-wider uppercase mb-1">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#38BDF8]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
        </svg>
        <span>Chronology</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]">Career & Academic Chronicle</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] max-w-md">
      A proven track record of shipping zero-failure infrastructure, automated IoT drivers, and modern system backends.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Connected Vertical Timeline -->
  <div class="space-y-6 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:left-3 sm:before:left-4 before:w-0.5 before:bg-[#1E293B]">
    <!-- Item 1: Skylink Innovations Ltd -->
    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6 pl-8 sm:pl-10 group">
      <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 top-3 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#38BDF8] ring-4 ring-[#090D16] group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:ring-[#38BDF8]/40 transition-all duration-200"></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#1E293B] bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-md w-full space-y-2 group-hover:border-[#38BDF8]/50 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-200">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#F8FAFC] group-hover:text-[#38BDF8] transition-colors">Skylink Innovations Ltd</h3>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#38BDF8] bg-[#090D16] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-[#1E293B] self-start sm:self-auto">Oct 2025 – Present</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#10B981]">IT Executive / Software & Systems Engineer</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] pt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Designed and deployed an all-in-one corporate portal (Java 21, Spring Boot 3.4, React, PostgreSQL) serving 50+ daily active staff with RBAC security, dynamic shift scheduling, and leave lifecycles. Developed native AdmsService handling real-time HTTP push communication from ZKTeco biometric terminals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Item 2: SPY Security Solutions -->
    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6 pl-8 sm:pl-10 group">
      <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 top-3 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981] ring-4 ring-[#090D16] group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:ring-[#10B981]/40 transition-all duration-200"></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#1E293B] bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-md w-full space-y-2 group-hover:border-[#10B981]/50 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-200">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#F8FAFC] group-hover:text-[#10B981] transition-colors">SPY Security Solutions</h3>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#10B981] bg-[#090D16] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-[#1E293B] self-start sm:self-auto">Mar 2024 – Oct 2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#38BDF8]">Software Executive / IoT & Systems Engineer</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] pt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Architected a multi-terminal commercial parking automation platform (PMS-V2) with a high-concurrency Rust (Axum 0.8 + Tokio) backend and Flutter (BLoC) cross-platform frontend. Integrated ZKTeco gate barrier controllers via ADMS, embedded live CCTV feeds over RTSP/HTTP, and engineered anti-passback rules.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Item 3: AMIE (IEB) -->
    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6 pl-8 sm:pl-10 group">
      <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 top-3 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#38BDF8] ring-4 ring-[#090D16] group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:ring-[#38BDF8]/40 transition-all duration-200"></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#1E293B] bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-md w-full space-y-2 group-hover:border-[#38BDF8]/50 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-200">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#F8FAFC] group-hover:text-[#38BDF8] transition-colors">B.Sc. in Engineering (Equivalence) — Section A</h3>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#38BDF8] bg-[#090D16] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-[#1E293B] self-start sm:self-auto">Enrolled 2026 (In Progress)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#94A3B8]">The Institution of Engineers, Bangladesh (IEB) — AMIE</div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] pt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Advanced engineering curriculum covering system analysis, discrete mathematics, distributed networks, and computational logic.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Item 4: Dhaka Polytechnic Institute -->
    <div class="relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6 pl-8 sm:pl-10 group">
      <div class="absolute left-1.5 sm:left-2.5 top-3 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981] ring-4 ring-[#090D16] group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:ring-[#10B981]/40 transition-all duration-200"></div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#1E293B] bg-[#0F172A]/70 backdrop-blur-md w-full space-y-2 group-hover:border-[#10B981]/50 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-200">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-1">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#F8FAFC] group-hover:text-[#10B981] transition-colors">Diploma in Engineering (Computer Science & Technology)</h3>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#10B981] bg-[#090D16] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-[#1E293B] self-start sm:self-auto">Session: 2021–2022</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#10B981]">
          Dhaka Polytechnic Institute (DPI) • <span class="text-[#F8FAFC] font-semibold">CGPA: 3.75 / 4.00 (Distinction)</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#94A3B8] pt-1 leading-relaxed">
          Foundational computer science, data structures, algorithms, operating system storage, and computer network engineering.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
